<item><title>Togo plans 1 500 hectares of new farm zones in Kara for 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-plans-1-500-hectares-of-new-farm-zones-in-kara-for-2027-edff1a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-plans-1-500-hectares-of-new-farm-zones-in-kara-for-2027-edff1a/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The state programme also provides for 1 500 hectares of lowlands, support for 155 existing zones and the opening of seven processing centres.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:42:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Togo&apos;s torture victims&apos; association urges release of 22 detainees</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-s-torture-victims-association-urges-release-of-22-0e3842/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-s-torture-victims-association-urges-release-of-22-0e3842/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The Association of Victims of Torture in Togo (ASVITTO) says 18 court decisions have not been enforced and asks for detainees&apos; release and compensation before June 2027.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:27:59 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-s-torture-victims-association-urges-release-of-22-0e3842/share.jpg" length="41664" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/togo-s-torture-victims-association-urges-release-of-22-0e3842/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
